<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting Qantas Customer Care regarding your QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} flight.<br />
<br />
I was sorry to hear that you encountered an issue with your seat, specifically (<em><strong>insert description of the issue provided by the customer</strong></em>)<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-if a frequent flyer</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. These should be reflected in your account shortly<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-if not a Frequent Flyer</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d be happy to credit {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your account once I have your Frequent Flyer number. If you're not yet a member, you can join for free using this <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with an exceptional experience from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed on your feedback to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and I hope we deliver an exceptional service next time you fly with Qantas.</p>
</body>
</html>